    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.If the effect triggers, it must activate.",
        "question": "If this card's [Your Turn] effect triggers, can I choose to not activate it?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.",
        "question": "Can I choose different Digimon for the Digimon that gains ＜Alliance＞ and the Digimon that attacks for this card's [Your Turn] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.",
        "question": "After my Digimon gains ＜Alliance＞ with this card's [Your Turn] effect, can I choose to not attack for the part of the effect after \"then\"?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No. You perform ＜De-Digivolve  1＞ (Trash the top card. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) twice, not ＜De-Digivolve  2＞ (Trash up to 2 cards from the top. You can't trash past level 3 cards.). \nWhen performing ＜De-Digivolve  2＞ (Trash up to 2 cards from the top. You can't trash past level 3 cards.), the top 2 cards are considered to be trashed at the same time, but when performing ＜De-Digivolve  1＞ (Trash the top card. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) twice, the top 2 cards are trashed 1 at a time. \n\nFor example, if using ＜De-Digivolve  2＞ (Trash up to 2 cards from the top. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) to simultaneously trash the top 2 cards of a suspended Digimon and the 2nd card trashed is BT15-047 [Kabuterimon], its effect won't activate. However, if performing ＜De-Digivolve  1＞ (Trash the top card. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) twice and the Digimon becomes BT15-047 [Kabuterimon] after the 1st instance of ＜De-Digivolve  1＞ (Trash the top card. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) trashes a card, it won't be affected by the 2nd instance of ＜De-Digivolve  1＞ (Trash the top card. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) and won't be trashed.",
        "question": "My Tamer has 4 colors.If this card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect activates, do I perform ＜De-Digivolve  2＞ (Trash up to 2 cards from the top. You can't trash past level 3 cards.)?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
